    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Tour combines step targets, masks, placement, indicators, and custom actions to build lightweight product guidance without leaving the current page.</source>
        <target state="translated">Tour 組合步驟目標、遮罩、彈出位置、指示器和自定義操作，在不離開當前頁面的情況下構建輕量級產品引導。</target>
